WEBVTT

00:25.710 --> 00:26.230
Let me.

00:27.230 --> 00:28.120
I can do it myself.

00:31.510 --> 00:33.280
Once you see what I can do,

00:33.840 --> 00:34.840
I'm afraid you'll never

00:35.390 --> 00:36.390
be able to do without me.

00:36.520 --> 00:38.640
When will you stop boasting like this?

00:39.960 --> 00:40.520
Don't move.

00:53.600 --> 00:54.640
Your Highness,

00:54.640 --> 00:56.208
Prince Xin and Prince Lie are here.

00:57.520 --> 00:58.560
Let them in.

00:58.704 --> 00:59.712
Yes, Your Highness.

00:59.920 --> 01:00.640
The two brothers

01:00.640 --> 01:02.560
must be here about their mother,
Consort Rong.

01:02.790 --> 01:03.840
You should go see them.

01:04.230 --> 01:05.150
There's no rush.

01:07.280 --> 01:08.480
My wife's beauty

01:08.840 --> 01:09.840
cannot be rushed.

01:21.040 --> 01:21.640
Don't move.

02:45.712 --> 02:46.570
=Blossoms of Power=

02:46.576 --> 02:49.580
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

02:49.660 --> 02:52.620
=Episode 23=

02:53.750 --> 02:54.240
All done.

03:00.688 --> 03:02.870
Zhen Zhu and I will head
to the Imperial Garden first.

03:02.870 --> 03:03.630
You can talk.

03:16.560 --> 03:17.520
Changqing, Changying,

03:18.030 --> 03:18.590
have a seat.

03:18.910 --> 03:20.240
My mother was outsmarted.

03:20.864 --> 03:22.224
The power over the inner palace

03:22.870 --> 03:24.560
rightfully belongs
to the Crown Princess.

03:24.784 --> 03:26.520
For our mother to relinquish her power

03:26.530 --> 03:27.990
and enjoy her twilight years in peace

03:28.030 --> 03:29.800
is also what Changying and I wish for.

03:30.280 --> 03:31.560
You and the Crown Princess

03:31.800 --> 03:32.710
can rest assured.

03:33.280 --> 03:34.080
Changqing,

03:35.710 --> 03:37.430
on the day of the blessing ceremony,

03:38.120 --> 03:39.630
Consort Rong had a meticulous plan

03:39.870 --> 03:41.680
and set a deadly trap for Xihe.

03:41.850 --> 03:44.390
Anyone else would have found it
impossible to escape unscathed.

03:44.400 --> 03:46.150
But she never dreamed that

03:46.310 --> 03:47.840
in just one confrontation with Xihe,

03:47.840 --> 03:49.170
she would suffer a crushing defeat.

03:49.190 --> 03:51.190
In order to frame the Crown Princess,
Consort Rong

03:51.190 --> 03:53.136
didn't hesitate
to damage the Emperor's prestige.

03:53.150 --> 03:55.750
If I were to report the full truth
to our father,

03:56.630 --> 03:57.680
her fate

03:57.744 --> 03:59.520
would be far worse
than just being grounded.

03:59.590 --> 04:00.840
Then why didn't you?

04:12.280 --> 04:12.960
Exactly.

04:14.590 --> 04:15.590
If it were me,

04:16.320 --> 04:18.310
I would never let her off so easily.

04:18.928 --> 04:21.744
It was the Crown Princess
who intentionally spared Consort Rong.

04:21.824 --> 04:24.240
The Crown Princess feels
that the inner palace struggles

04:24.510 --> 04:25.830
have already claimed two lives.

04:26.270 --> 04:28.270
She has no desire
to drive anyone to their death.

04:28.480 --> 04:29.480
Since that's the case,

04:30.240 --> 04:31.430
we will let this matter rest.

04:33.040 --> 04:34.920
You two brothers are both smart men.

04:35.800 --> 04:37.310
Consort Rong losing her power

04:37.310 --> 04:38.360
is actually a good thing

04:38.750 --> 04:40.000
for the two of you.

04:40.208 --> 04:41.800
Otherwise, with her in a high position

04:41.800 --> 04:43.480
and so obsessed with power,

04:43.560 --> 04:44.630
who knows

04:44.630 --> 04:46.720
how much trouble she would cause
in the future?

04:52.880 --> 04:54.950
We are grateful
for the Crown Princess's mercy.

04:56.270 --> 04:57.630
I wonder how the two of us

04:58.240 --> 04:59.920
can be of service to the Crown Princess.

04:59.920 --> 05:01.390
The Crown Princess has me by her side.

05:01.800 --> 05:03.240
She doesn't need your service.

05:04.310 --> 05:05.920
Just remember this favor,

05:05.984 --> 05:07.408
and that will be enough.

05:08.270 --> 05:09.720
Changying and I

05:10.070 --> 05:10.950
will certainly

05:11.136 --> 05:13.344
keep this favor
from the Crown Princess in mind.

05:17.870 --> 05:18.870
Your Highness,

05:19.600 --> 05:20.560
take care of yourself.

05:20.560 --> 05:21.560
We will take our leave.

05:22.560 --> 05:23.190
Farewell.

05:35.120 --> 05:35.720
Your Highness,

05:36.390 --> 05:37.870
why did you make the two of them

05:37.870 --> 05:39.472
remember the Crown Princess's kindness?

05:39.520 --> 05:41.856
The fact that these two brothers
admire the Crown Princess

05:41.872 --> 05:43.536
is known to the entire imperial capital.

05:43.750 --> 05:45.184
If they continue to pine for her now,

05:45.232 --> 05:47.070
wouldn't it be even more troublesome?

05:47.070 --> 05:48.680
Unrequited love breeds hatred.

05:49.630 --> 05:51.560
I want to turn their admiration for Xihe

05:51.560 --> 05:52.480
into gratitude.

05:53.720 --> 05:54.720
With gratitude,

05:55.190 --> 05:56.750
their relationship with Xihe

05:57.070 --> 05:58.430
can be long-lasting and stable.

05:58.480 --> 06:00.752
If their relationship with Crown
Princess is long-lasting and stable,

06:00.896 --> 06:01.632
what about you?

06:01.920 --> 06:02.870
Aren't you jealous?

06:06.080 --> 06:07.008
These two brothers,

06:07.040 --> 06:09.170
one excels in literature
and the other in martial arts,

06:09.190 --> 06:10.390
are exceptionally talented.

06:10.560 --> 06:11.950
They are highly regarded by my father

06:11.950 --> 06:13.328
and respected by all the officials.

06:13.360 --> 06:14.240
If they are friends,

06:14.800 --> 06:16.000
we would be even more powerful.

06:16.430 --> 06:17.430
If they are enemies...

06:22.630 --> 06:24.070
I'm afraid that if I'm gone one day,

06:24.270 --> 06:25.560
Xihe will be all alone.

06:26.270 --> 06:27.630
Don't always think like that.

06:32.000 --> 06:33.870
I know my survival is uncertain,

06:35.360 --> 06:36.950
yet I can't bear to let her go.

06:40.070 --> 06:41.950
Every time I see her,

06:43.560 --> 06:44.750
besides feeling joyful,

06:45.600 --> 06:46.920
I can't help but wonder,

06:49.480 --> 06:51.190
if I'm really gone one day,

06:51.680 --> 06:53.000
what else can I do for her?

06:53.720 --> 06:54.680
How can I

06:55.630 --> 06:57.190
fulfill her wishes?

06:58.510 --> 06:59.160
Your Highness,

06:59.510 --> 07:00.950
you will surely live a long life.

07:01.480 --> 07:02.360
Physician Xie said

07:02.360 --> 07:04.160
he will do everything he can
to find a way.

07:07.630 --> 07:08.510
Don't worry.

07:09.680 --> 07:11.240
Now that I have someone I deeply love,

07:11.950 --> 07:13.240
this broken body of mine

07:13.240 --> 07:14.800
no longer belongs to me alone.

07:15.630 --> 07:17.070
How could I bear to leave her?

07:26.992 --> 07:28.832
When His Highness takes his medicine
at night,

07:29.000 --> 07:30.360
in his decoction,

07:30.528 --> 07:32.240
add a spoonful of Slender-Leaf Qionghua.

07:32.680 --> 07:33.190
Understood.

07:37.680 --> 07:39.390
You've put so much thought into this,

07:39.560 --> 07:41.480
why not tell His Highness?

07:42.160 --> 07:43.720
He would definitely be overjoyed.

08:42.912 --> 08:44.528
What's wrong, Your Highness?

08:45.630 --> 08:47.080
After drinking the medicine today,

08:47.550 --> 08:49.120
my lungs feel much more refreshed.

08:50.080 --> 08:51.550
Did Yunhuai change the prescription?

08:51.550 --> 08:52.240
No.

08:52.440 --> 08:53.630
It's the same as usual.

09:03.568 --> 09:05.760
It indeed feels much more comfortable
than before.

09:18.510 --> 09:19.080
All right.

09:49.664 --> 09:52.032
Xihe, drink a bowl of ginseng soup
before you sleep.

10:08.000 --> 10:09.104
I'll drink it myself.

10:10.030 --> 10:11.390
I just took the medicine,

10:12.550 --> 10:15.200
and the burning sensation
in my lungs is gone.

10:15.750 --> 10:16.840
I finally realize

10:16.848 --> 10:18.672
that being free from illness and pain

10:19.030 --> 10:20.320
is so pleasant.

10:29.150 --> 10:31.320
I've never liked owing people favors.

10:32.120 --> 10:33.510
We agreed on mutual benefit,

10:33.670 --> 10:34.550
and I keep my word.

10:38.240 --> 10:40.480
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

10:41.810 --> 10:44.060
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

10:45.380 --> 10:50.660
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

10:52.590 --> 10:55.530
♪I've hidden so many words♪

10:56.150 --> 10:58.950
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

10:59.910 --> 11:01.480
If you keep looking at me like that,

11:03.870 --> 11:06.840
I might not be able
to restrain myself much longer.

11:06.980 --> 11:09.340
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

11:10.470 --> 11:13.200
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

11:14.160 --> 11:19.500
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

11:21.260 --> 11:24.080
♪Every answer I gave♪

11:24.880 --> 11:27.730
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

11:28.520 --> 11:31.890
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

11:32.150 --> 11:35.460
♪How hard it truly was?♪

11:38.430 --> 11:41.870
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

11:42.860 --> 11:45.190
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

11:48.870 --> 11:50.240
Looking at me like this,

11:51.390 --> 11:52.870
do you think I

11:54.120 --> 11:55.270
am a feast for the eyes?

11:57.670 --> 11:58.750
I see you as someone

11:59.150 --> 12:01.120
I can weather any storm with.

12:02.960 --> 12:04.670
I don't want to weather storms with you.

12:05.390 --> 12:06.600
I'd rather

12:07.720 --> 12:08.790
share your bed.

12:10.320 --> 12:12.360
Why are you always so frivolous?

12:18.750 --> 12:19.670
What is this?

12:19.870 --> 12:20.670
The line.

13:11.120 --> 13:12.000
Your Highness,

13:13.720 --> 13:16.150
I hope you keep your promise
and follow the rules.

13:16.440 --> 13:17.840
You are bullying me again.

13:19.720 --> 13:20.750
The bell didn't ring.

13:44.840 --> 13:45.790
What are you doing?

13:47.390 --> 13:48.600
Ever since I was a child,

13:49.000 --> 13:50.270
I've been terrified of thunder.

13:52.150 --> 13:53.600
If I hadn't seen with my own eyes

13:53.670 --> 13:55.510
that you take three lives
all by yourself,

13:55.536 --> 13:56.840
I almost would have believed you.

14:00.790 --> 14:01.750
I'm really scared.

14:01.750 --> 14:03.200
Go away. Move over.

14:07.630 --> 14:09.030
But with the bell ringing like this,

14:09.360 --> 14:10.480
I can't sleep either.

14:10.528 --> 14:11.630
As long as you don't move,

14:12.000 --> 14:13.200
the bell won't ring.

14:26.620 --> 14:33.140
(Clarity and Serenity)

14:38.700 --> 14:43.420
(As Exquisite As Snow)

14:44.030 --> 14:44.870
Tian Yuan,

14:45.200 --> 14:46.750
do you have any siblings?

14:47.088 --> 14:48.390
I have a younger brother.

14:59.750 --> 15:02.120
Your brother isn't named Di Fang, is he?

15:03.200 --> 15:03.720
Yes.

15:04.480 --> 15:05.440
His name is Di Fang.

15:15.180 --> 15:16.940
(Clarity and Serenity)

15:30.000 --> 15:31.510
Today, I'm going to Sixian Hall.

15:31.536 --> 15:33.540
It's my first time meeting
those female officials.

15:33.550 --> 15:35.510
What are your plans after court?

15:37.320 --> 15:38.440
Are you trying

15:39.200 --> 15:40.750
to make me report my whereabouts?

15:43.360 --> 15:45.840
You sound just like a new bride
questioning her husband.

15:55.270 --> 15:55.870
Wear this.

16:12.912 --> 16:16.016
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

16:16.464 --> 16:18.992
Today, I take on the heavy
responsibilities of the East Palace,

16:19.480 --> 16:20.600
and manage the inner palace.

16:21.008 --> 16:23.120
Holding my first morning assembly
at Sixian Hall,

16:23.140 --> 16:24.900
you all must fulfill
your respective duties,

16:24.912 --> 16:26.480
and not disappoint His Majesty.

16:26.870 --> 16:29.790
- We will keep that in mind.
- We will keep that in mind.

16:29.790 --> 16:31.120
I reviewed some accounts today.

16:32.192 --> 16:34.640
The General Palace Service's
monthly allowance from last month

16:34.790 --> 16:36.270
was overspent by 300 bolts of silk.

16:36.790 --> 16:38.870
It was claimed to be
for the repair of Hanliang Hall.

16:39.120 --> 16:40.320
But as far as I know,

16:40.320 --> 16:41.320
this expense

16:41.488 --> 16:44.192
should have been covered
by the Palace Domestic Service.

16:52.670 --> 16:53.480
Record Officer Liu,

16:53.490 --> 16:54.960
bring out the General Palace Service's

16:55.008 --> 16:56.992
tally records
with the Palace Domestic Service.

16:58.600 --> 16:59.670
I deserve to die.

17:00.240 --> 17:01.480
For the repair of Hanliang Hall,

17:01.600 --> 17:03.080
300 glazed tiles were just replaced,

17:03.090 --> 17:04.990
and five pillars of golden-thread
Zhennan were added.

17:05.008 --> 17:06.820
Your Highness,
you summoned us so suddenly,

17:06.880 --> 17:08.630
I haven't had the time to record it
in the ledger yet.

17:08.640 --> 17:11.030
But every expense is clearly traceable.

17:11.310 --> 17:11.960
Is that so?

17:13.790 --> 17:14.960
To answer Your Highness,

17:14.960 --> 17:18.030
by rule, accounts are only tallied
and recorded at the end of the month.

17:18.550 --> 17:19.510
Record Officer Liu

17:20.030 --> 17:21.200
has done nothing wrong.

17:23.070 --> 17:23.830
Kneel.

17:28.432 --> 17:31.248
The Palace Domestic Service
allocated funds for repairs last month.

17:31.440 --> 17:32.510
The tally number is

17:33.000 --> 17:34.160
Bingxu 79.

17:37.110 --> 17:39.510
Yet the General Palace Service
used inferior materials,

17:39.880 --> 17:42.000
replacing them with old tiles
and golden camphor,

17:42.512 --> 17:43.680
and reported false accounts.

17:44.080 --> 17:46.310
Whose pockets did the money
from both sides go into?

17:51.200 --> 17:52.200
Wardrobe Mistress Jiang,

17:53.216 --> 17:55.264
during the Dragon Boat Festival
three years ago,

17:55.360 --> 17:57.160
did you withdraw a batch
of cloud brocade

17:57.160 --> 17:58.590
from the storehouse?

17:58.590 --> 17:59.440
Yes.

18:00.368 --> 18:02.950
(Signed by Wardrobe Mistress Jiang)
Why is the ink of this record

18:03.000 --> 18:03.856
darker than the rest?

18:05.350 --> 18:06.720
Using old ledger paper

18:07.000 --> 18:08.440
to copy with new ink.

18:09.296 --> 18:10.720
It must have been hard for you.

18:10.768 --> 18:13.648
You even managed to find the
green vine paper used three years ago.

18:13.920 --> 18:15.030
I deserve to die.

18:15.200 --> 18:17.350
I beg you for forgiveness,
Your Highness.

18:18.790 --> 18:20.720
You are all veterans in the palace.

18:21.216 --> 18:23.920
Have you become so accustomed
to a life of leisure and luxury

18:24.030 --> 18:26.030
that you focus all your thoughts
on embezzlement?

18:29.830 --> 18:30.750
Matron Cui,

18:32.030 --> 18:33.510
how should this matter be handled?

18:37.240 --> 18:38.480
To answer Your Highness,

18:38.592 --> 18:39.760
according to the law,

18:39.968 --> 18:42.110
those who embezzle more
than ten strings of coins

18:42.288 --> 18:44.790
will receive twenty lashes
and forfeit three months' salary.

18:44.832 --> 18:46.390
Those who embezzle more
than fifty strings of coins

18:46.400 --> 18:48.640
will receive eighty blows
and be demoted to menial labor.

18:50.032 --> 18:51.780
For more than
one hundred strings of coins,

18:51.824 --> 18:53.200
exile for 3,000 km,

18:53.640 --> 18:54.880
and confiscation of property.

18:59.510 --> 19:00.830
There's no need to recover

19:00.880 --> 19:02.496
the overspent money this time.

19:06.064 --> 19:08.512
Since you two record officers
love repairing palaces,

19:09.030 --> 19:10.350
I will grant your wish.

19:11.030 --> 19:13.440
Two halls and three pavilions
in the Six Palaces caught fire.

19:13.504 --> 19:15.500
The Ministry of Works said
it requires 900 strings of coins.

19:15.510 --> 19:16.550
I will only give you 600.

19:17.160 --> 19:19.440
The remaining deficit,
you'll make up for it yourselves.

19:19.450 --> 19:20.990
Thank you for your mercy, Your Highness.

19:21.100 --> 19:22.680
Thank you for your mercy, Your Highness.

19:23.240 --> 19:24.200
Wardrobe Mistress Jiang,

19:25.070 --> 19:27.776
what you should do
with these shady old accounts,

19:27.808 --> 19:29.480
I shouldn't have to teach you, right?

19:29.480 --> 19:31.110
Thank you for your mercy, Your Highness.

19:31.270 --> 19:32.160
From this day forward,

19:32.790 --> 19:35.000
all services must clear their backlogs,

19:35.344 --> 19:36.590
reorganize their accounts,

19:36.608 --> 19:38.030
and thoroughly inspect the gates.

19:38.720 --> 19:40.030
If there are any more mistakes,

19:40.590 --> 19:41.830
I will definitely not spare you.

19:42.448 --> 19:44.144
- Yes, Your Highness.
- Yes, Your Highness.

19:50.110 --> 19:52.030
The state classics
of the Hongwen Pavilion,

19:52.310 --> 19:54.070
the mathematics
of the Chongwen Pavilion,

19:55.350 --> 19:56.960
annotations in indigo ink,

19:57.232 --> 19:58.720
and promotions in official ranks,

19:58.960 --> 20:00.720
I can grant them all to you one by one.

20:00.848 --> 20:03.440
Whether you are an embroiderer
from the Palace Workshop Service,

20:03.510 --> 20:05.200
a cook from the Imperial Food Service,

20:05.750 --> 20:07.720
or even a maid
from the Palace Laundry Service,

20:08.000 --> 20:09.000
merit will be rewarded,

20:09.088 --> 20:10.592
and the capable will be promoted.

20:11.312 --> 20:12.992
The palace is a vast and complex world.

20:13.008 --> 20:14.630
But I will not let
your talents be buried.

20:14.640 --> 20:16.680
The abacus skills you practiced
by the window,

20:16.880 --> 20:18.510
the texts you memorized by lamplight,

20:18.944 --> 20:21.160
the embroidery patterns
hidden by your pillows...

20:22.270 --> 20:23.400
From this day forward,

20:24.200 --> 20:25.400
talent shall be your vessel,

20:25.830 --> 20:27.030
and ability your oar.

20:27.750 --> 20:28.880
In my hands,

20:29.110 --> 20:30.720
this seal
for managing the Six Palaces

20:31.680 --> 20:33.480
can support a woman's soaring ambitions

20:33.632 --> 20:35.232
and her strategies to secure the nation.

20:35.400 --> 20:36.350
I will allow you all

20:36.560 --> 20:38.480
to earn your positions
through your talents.

20:42.144 --> 20:44.896
- Thank you, Your Highness.
- Thank you, Your Highness.

20:52.830 --> 20:53.480
Tired?

20:54.310 --> 20:55.160
Come have a seat.

21:06.000 --> 21:07.590
You've worked hard all day.

21:08.160 --> 21:09.510
You should relax.

21:21.030 --> 21:22.350
By tomorrow, the entire palace

21:22.368 --> 21:23.920
will surely be calling me ferocious.

21:24.816 --> 21:26.416
What's wrong with being ferocious?

21:26.790 --> 21:28.030
I happen to like ferocious.

21:32.480 --> 21:34.480
When you're out there,
you're a force of nature,

21:34.550 --> 21:35.680
decisive and commanding.

21:36.110 --> 21:37.240
And I'm at home,

21:37.240 --> 21:38.740
obediently waiting for you to return.

21:38.800 --> 21:39.744
This feeling

21:40.160 --> 21:41.160
is incredibly reassuring.

21:48.736 --> 21:50.270
Your favorite plum blossom candy.

21:55.550 --> 21:56.960
I suppose I can be considered

21:57.160 --> 21:58.830
a competent, supportive husband.

22:00.960 --> 22:02.030
Your words

22:02.096 --> 22:03.968
make me feel
I've truly overstepped my bounds.

22:06.790 --> 22:07.880
You don't have to be gentle.

22:08.304 --> 22:10.048
And you don't have to be virtuous.

22:10.272 --> 22:12.384
I'm willing
to be your supportive husband.

22:12.750 --> 22:14.830
I will always support your ambitions.

22:16.640 --> 22:17.550
My wife

22:18.440 --> 22:19.960
will be my lifelong glory.

22:25.900 --> 22:29.380
(Qianli Horse Shop)

22:29.400 --> 22:30.440
Come and take a look.

22:32.030 --> 22:33.160
Come again soon.

22:33.160 --> 22:34.340
(Yuheng Gate)

22:35.240 --> 22:36.240
I want a hot one.

22:38.480 --> 22:40.110
The quality of this saddle is excellent.

22:40.110 --> 22:41.070
Sturdy and durable.

22:42.000 --> 22:42.720
Yes.

22:42.790 --> 22:45.310
This tassel is very beautiful. Look.

22:58.128 --> 22:59.920
Young Lady,
if you wish to buy riding gear,

22:59.920 --> 23:01.360
you only need to tell the butler.

23:01.550 --> 23:03.110
This is not a place you should be.

23:03.440 --> 23:04.640
If we're here today

23:05.000 --> 23:06.590
and run into someone we know,

23:07.070 --> 23:08.790
your reputation will be...

23:09.160 --> 23:11.070
The riding gear I want is custom-made.

23:11.240 --> 23:12.680
Uncle Qing can't read blueprints.

23:12.750 --> 23:14.140
It would be useless for him to come.

23:14.790 --> 23:15.920
Don't worry, nanny.

23:16.350 --> 23:18.550
Those well-bred young ladies
from noble families

23:18.720 --> 23:20.240
would never come to a place like this.

23:24.830 --> 23:26.400
What kind of horse do you want?

23:27.440 --> 23:29.160
Not enough money. Where's your money?

23:29.160 --> 23:29.680
Here.

23:29.680 --> 23:30.680
Pay him before he gives it to you.

23:30.680 --> 23:31.792
Is that what this means?

23:31.830 --> 23:34.270
This is already the cheapest.

23:34.440 --> 23:35.400
Add a little more money.

23:35.880 --> 23:37.110
Nanny, wait for me here.

23:37.110 --> 23:37.880
I'll be right back.

23:39.270 --> 23:40.160
Where are you going?

23:40.160 --> 23:41.480
This one is fast.

23:41.480 --> 23:42.656
This one has great stamina.

23:43.030 --> 23:44.200
They're all fine horses.

23:44.200 --> 23:45.240
What does this mean?

23:45.240 --> 23:45.880
It's a purebred.

23:45.880 --> 23:46.480
I don't know.

23:46.920 --> 23:47.880
Your Highness.

23:49.590 --> 23:50.270
What's wrong?

23:50.350 --> 23:51.440
What happened?

23:51.440 --> 23:52.400
We want five horses.

23:52.400 --> 23:53.240
But for some reason,

23:53.240 --> 23:55.240
the owner is very agitated.

23:56.880 --> 23:57.550
Hello,

23:57.550 --> 23:59.510
these men are my friends.

23:59.510 --> 24:00.590
They mean no harm.

24:00.784 --> 24:03.152
They're just not familiar
with the Suta language.

24:03.510 --> 24:05.350
Was there some misunderstanding?

24:07.110 --> 24:08.350
They want to buy several horses,

24:08.350 --> 24:09.920
but they think the price is too high.

24:09.920 --> 24:12.550
But this really is my lowest price.

24:13.830 --> 24:15.750
The owner thinks
you're haggling over the price.

24:16.310 --> 24:17.200
No.

24:17.350 --> 24:18.750
We want more fine horses.

24:18.750 --> 24:19.790
Money is not an issue.

24:19.790 --> 24:20.240
Yes.

24:20.790 --> 24:24.750
They want five good horses.

24:24.750 --> 24:26.440
Price is not an issue.

24:27.104 --> 24:28.288
Let's go pick the horses.

24:28.336 --> 24:29.160
You can take them.

24:29.160 --> 24:29.550
Let's go.

24:29.550 --> 24:30.224
Give it to me.

24:30.510 --> 24:31.070
Follow me.

24:33.248 --> 24:35.552
Thank you for helping me out,
County Princess Huaiyang.

24:35.720 --> 24:38.070
I didn't expect you to be fluent
in Suta.

24:38.160 --> 24:40.110
I used to be Princess Pingling's
study companion.

24:40.440 --> 24:42.070
I learned a little Suta with her.

24:42.640 --> 24:43.680
I only know the basics.

24:43.680 --> 24:45.552
It's just enough to get by
when shopping.

24:51.248 --> 24:52.350
Careful, County Princess.

24:52.368 --> 24:53.872
This horse hasn't been tamed yet.

25:00.000 --> 25:00.440
Come.

25:07.070 --> 25:08.480
You have a good eye, Your Highness.

25:08.560 --> 25:10.400
This is a famous horse
from the Western Regions.

25:10.410 --> 25:11.568
It can travel 1,000 km a day.

25:11.616 --> 25:14.290
It crosses rivers and climbs mountains
as if walking on flat ground.

25:14.310 --> 25:17.160
The King of Ningyuan in the Western
Regions once presented two to us.

25:17.184 --> 25:19.248
They were deeply loved
by the late Emperor.

25:19.830 --> 25:20.920
I didn't expect you

25:20.976 --> 25:23.200
to be so knowledgeable
about horses as well.

25:23.750 --> 25:24.920
I love riding horses.

25:24.920 --> 25:25.790
I know a thing or two.

25:26.270 --> 25:27.750
You flatter me, Your Highness.

25:30.960 --> 25:32.400
Greetings, Your Highness.

25:33.440 --> 25:35.200
Young Lady, it's getting late.

25:35.270 --> 25:36.350
We should head back.

25:36.680 --> 25:37.270
Okay.

25:38.270 --> 25:39.830
I will take my leave now.

25:39.830 --> 25:41.100
Please excuse me, Your Highness.

25:42.310 --> 25:43.510
Thank you again for your help.

25:44.700 --> 25:46.950
It's just that warhorses are hard
to come by in the army.

25:46.960 --> 25:50.160
I want to ask these people about how
to raise horses and prevent diseases.

25:50.480 --> 25:52.920
I wonder if you could spare some time
these next few days...

25:52.960 --> 25:54.680
To be able to help the soldiers
in the army

25:54.680 --> 25:55.790
would be my honor.

25:56.270 --> 25:58.070
Your Highness, if you need anything,

25:58.070 --> 25:59.488
you can come find me anytime.

26:02.460 --> 26:04.860
(Yong'an Palace)

26:04.880 --> 26:08.310
I heard you've been getting close
to Prince Lie lately.

26:11.750 --> 26:13.030
If you're interested in him,

26:13.400 --> 26:15.160
just tell me.

26:16.030 --> 26:18.640
I deeply thank you for worrying
about my marriage, Your Highness.

26:19.270 --> 26:20.240
However,

26:21.070 --> 26:23.440
I'm afraid I must
decline your kind offer.

26:24.440 --> 26:25.720
What do you mean?

26:28.160 --> 26:29.590
I have made up my mind

26:29.880 --> 26:30.880
to never marry.

26:30.928 --> 26:32.440
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

26:32.440 --> 26:33.680
Women in this world,

26:35.030 --> 26:37.880
other than nuns
who have entered the convent,

26:38.200 --> 26:39.640
have no reason not to marry.

26:40.030 --> 26:42.000
You are the daughter of the Duke of Wei.

26:42.000 --> 26:43.350
You have a noble status.

26:43.440 --> 26:46.480
You have excellent looks and character.

26:46.550 --> 26:48.030
Why wouldn't you marry?

26:48.350 --> 26:49.590
I believe

26:50.960 --> 26:53.480
if I am lucky enough
to meet someone I truly love,

26:54.000 --> 26:56.000
marriage would naturally be a blessing.

26:56.310 --> 26:58.440
Just like my sister
and the Crown Prince.

26:58.512 --> 27:00.440
That's a love
that even immortals would envy.

27:03.480 --> 27:04.510
But,

27:05.160 --> 27:07.510
if I am not destined
to meet someone I love,

27:07.960 --> 27:08.750
not marrying

27:09.000 --> 27:11.110
is also a perfectly fine choice.

27:11.110 --> 27:12.750
You are still young.

27:12.750 --> 27:16.270
People will say your standards
are too high and you refuse to settle.

27:17.240 --> 27:19.920
If you grow older
and still can't get married,

27:20.030 --> 27:22.240
you will be criticized by others.

27:22.240 --> 27:23.350
I am not afraid of that.

27:23.550 --> 27:24.590
My mind is made up.

27:24.590 --> 27:25.310
Nonsense.

27:30.830 --> 27:34.270
Do your father, brother,
and sister know about this?

27:34.590 --> 27:36.200
This is my own business.

27:36.550 --> 27:39.240
Even they cannot change my mind.

27:39.640 --> 27:40.830
Since ancient times,

27:41.110 --> 27:44.160
children's marriages have always
been decided by their parents.

27:44.640 --> 27:46.070
Go back and tell your sister

27:46.200 --> 27:47.920
to teach you some sense.

27:50.270 --> 27:50.920
Yes.

27:51.550 --> 27:52.550
I will do as you say.

28:00.350 --> 28:01.440
I've prepared your bathwater

28:01.510 --> 28:03.110
in the side room for you.

28:03.240 --> 28:04.680
Have a good soak and relax.

28:05.310 --> 28:06.000
All right.

28:07.024 --> 28:08.800
You're getting more and more perceptive.

28:08.830 --> 28:09.790
You may leave.

28:24.510 --> 28:25.030
Who's there?

28:25.510 --> 28:26.070
Come out!

28:31.240 --> 28:32.160
It's me.

28:32.350 --> 28:33.550
Cui Jinbai?

28:35.550 --> 28:37.880
You snuck into my bathroom...

28:37.880 --> 28:38.944
What... What do you want?

28:39.240 --> 28:39.640
I...

28:40.030 --> 28:41.200
I didn't do it on purpose.

28:41.590 --> 28:42.960
I just wanted to talk to you,

28:43.110 --> 28:44.200
so I waited for you inside.

28:44.240 --> 28:46.440
I didn't know Jin Shan
would come in to draw a bath.

28:46.480 --> 28:47.920
He left right after pouring the water,

28:47.920 --> 28:49.550
and closed the door
to stand guard outside.

28:49.550 --> 28:50.440
I... I couldn't get out.

28:50.440 --> 28:51.440
A likely story.

28:52.200 --> 28:54.110
You... You sneaked into my room.

28:54.110 --> 28:55.248
You're just being insolent

28:55.310 --> 28:57.750
and acting like a total lecher.

28:59.920 --> 29:01.440
Me, a lecher?

29:02.440 --> 29:04.200
Why don't you think
about what you've done?

29:05.070 --> 29:06.070
When we first met,

29:06.270 --> 29:07.310
you pestered me every day.

29:11.440 --> 29:12.368
Perfect timing.

29:12.384 --> 29:14.680
Is the water warm enough?
Let me add some more.

29:14.680 --> 29:15.640
Who let you in?

29:16.030 --> 29:16.720
Lecher!

29:16.920 --> 29:17.480
Get out!

29:29.030 --> 29:29.790
What are you doing?

29:30.680 --> 29:32.030
It's still early.

29:32.030 --> 29:33.216
And you're already in bed?

29:34.590 --> 29:35.070
Come here.

29:36.200 --> 29:37.400
I have a question for you.

29:40.880 --> 29:41.720
Did you just buy it?

29:41.920 --> 29:42.510
It's so new.

29:54.240 --> 29:56.550
I've never had feelings
for anyone else in my life,

29:56.680 --> 29:57.750
so I don't know

29:58.030 --> 29:59.550
how to make the person I like happy.

30:00.550 --> 30:01.720
I had to copy your example.

30:01.840 --> 30:03.510
It's really hard to learn good things,

30:03.510 --> 30:04.928
but so easy to pick up bad habits.

30:05.030 --> 30:06.000
Don't copy me.

30:06.590 --> 30:07.920
For my absurd behavior back then,

30:07.920 --> 30:09.888
how many times have I apologized to you?

30:09.920 --> 30:11.000
What do you mean by that?

30:15.510 --> 30:16.350
Do you regret it?

30:19.240 --> 30:20.110
Of course I regret it.

30:20.110 --> 30:21.880
I regret it more than anything.

30:28.680 --> 30:30.830
Cui Jinbai knows your true identity.

30:30.928 --> 30:32.800
Risking the charge
of deceiving the Emperor,

30:32.864 --> 30:34.270
he is still deeply in love with you.

30:34.960 --> 30:36.000
That's truly rare.

30:38.550 --> 30:39.070
No.

30:39.920 --> 30:41.480
I need to go see Madam Liu.

30:41.830 --> 30:42.830
Why see her?

30:43.070 --> 30:44.680
To have her arrange a marriage for me.

30:44.680 --> 30:45.750
Arrange a marriage for you?

30:46.030 --> 30:47.590
Not a real one.

30:47.590 --> 30:48.920
I just want to use this marriage

30:49.550 --> 30:50.750
to fend off Cui Jinbai.

30:53.400 --> 30:55.000
You're just digging a bigger hole

30:55.400 --> 30:57.310
to fill a smaller one.

31:06.270 --> 31:07.750
Young Lady Meng, after you.

31:08.880 --> 31:10.000
Thank you, Young Master.

31:12.750 --> 31:14.440
I heard from Madam Liu

31:14.550 --> 31:15.790
that in the Imperial Guard,

31:15.790 --> 31:16.864
you are highly respected.

31:16.928 --> 31:18.400
You've solved cases
and earned merit,

31:18.400 --> 31:19.968
and are deeply trusted by His Majesty.

31:20.000 --> 31:22.070
You are also straightforward
and upright,

31:22.070 --> 31:23.440
often standing up for justice

31:23.440 --> 31:24.350
and helping the weak.

31:24.790 --> 31:26.720
Truly a role model for young talents.

31:27.160 --> 31:28.400
You flatter me, Young Lady Meng.

31:28.750 --> 31:30.240
It's not my credit alone.

31:30.320 --> 31:32.000
Without the cooperation
of my subordinates,

31:32.000 --> 31:33.240
with just my own strength,

31:33.280 --> 31:34.590
I would never have succeeded.

31:35.070 --> 31:36.030
Young Master Bu,

31:36.200 --> 31:38.070
you truly don't take all the credit.

31:38.400 --> 31:39.590
You are so humble and modest.

31:40.160 --> 31:41.680
Truly a man of noble character.

31:45.160 --> 31:46.030
I wonder,

31:46.830 --> 31:47.750
what kind

31:48.070 --> 31:49.720
of ladies do you like?

31:52.160 --> 31:53.000
I think...

31:55.680 --> 31:56.720
What are you doing here?

31:58.288 --> 32:00.480
Coming to a teahouse,
naturally, is to drink tea.

32:00.512 --> 32:01.990
I heard you were on a blind date here,

32:02.016 --> 32:03.008
so I came to take a look.

32:03.550 --> 32:04.510
Greetings, Young Lady.

32:05.270 --> 32:06.200
Are you done looking?

32:06.200 --> 32:07.792
If you're done, hurry up and leave.

32:08.400 --> 32:10.400
You ordered so many
of my favorite pastries.

32:10.790 --> 32:12.200
Did you know I was coming?

32:12.200 --> 32:13.110
Your favorites?

32:13.110 --> 32:14.200
I just ordered randomly.

32:14.680 --> 32:16.920
You ordered randomly,
yet they suit my taste perfectly.

32:17.056 --> 32:18.590
Young Master, it seems you and I

32:19.160 --> 32:20.960
are truly on the same wavelength.

32:24.560 --> 32:25.792
I already took a bite.

32:26.110 --> 32:26.550
Want some?

32:28.200 --> 32:29.110
Shut up.

32:31.504 --> 32:33.200
We were just talking about flying kites.

32:33.640 --> 32:35.960
How about we go fly kites together
tomorrow?

32:35.960 --> 32:36.480
Sure.

32:36.560 --> 32:37.648
Let's all go together.

32:40.240 --> 32:41.830
Young Master Bu and I are good friends.

32:42.510 --> 32:43.750
He's always been reckless,

32:43.750 --> 32:45.136
so I really can't help but worry.

32:45.200 --> 32:46.656
That's why, no matter what he does,

32:47.110 --> 32:48.030
I have to be with him.

32:55.350 --> 32:57.480
I heard that when you were in Shunan,

32:57.480 --> 32:58.680
my aunt took great care of you.

32:58.750 --> 33:00.070
Her birthday is coming up,

33:00.960 --> 33:02.270
so I've prepared a small gift.

33:02.960 --> 33:04.400
I'd like to ask you to pass it on.

33:04.480 --> 33:05.590
I hope she likes it.

33:14.960 --> 33:16.790
This is a Celestial Silk Brocade Quilt.

33:16.832 --> 33:18.200
It was a gift from Crown Prince.

33:18.200 --> 33:20.352
It's the only one of its kind
in the imperial capital.

33:21.104 --> 33:21.790
Young Master Bu,

33:22.110 --> 33:23.000
please

33:23.240 --> 33:24.310
give this to Aunt for me.

33:31.880 --> 33:32.480
Great tea.

33:36.300 --> 33:39.020
(East Palace)

33:40.030 --> 33:41.350
You must know by now.

33:41.520 --> 33:44.416
Empress Dowager wants to arrange
a marriage between you and Prince Lie.

33:44.550 --> 33:45.550
What are your thoughts?

33:46.160 --> 33:47.880
What do you and Father think?

33:48.200 --> 33:50.350
Do you also want me
to marry as soon as possible?

33:52.070 --> 33:53.310
You're overthinking this.

33:53.968 --> 33:55.680
You're the daughter of the Duke of Wei.

33:56.310 --> 33:57.480
Now that you've come of age,

33:57.568 --> 34:00.688
the Empress Dowager and His Majesty
will naturally look into your marriage.

34:01.480 --> 34:03.350
If you don't have feelings
for Prince Lie,

34:04.030 --> 34:05.790
it's fine if you have
someone else in mind.

34:16.880 --> 34:18.400
Among all the princes,

34:19.000 --> 34:21.000
Prince Lie is a man of good character.

34:21.216 --> 34:23.280
He's also a capable general
who expands our borders

34:23.360 --> 34:24.760
and defends our country.

34:25.110 --> 34:26.510
His Majesty values him highly.

34:26.520 --> 34:28.350
He's already the General
of the Gallant Cavalry,

34:28.360 --> 34:29.590
and his future is limitless.

34:30.280 --> 34:31.280
As your sister,

34:32.000 --> 34:33.670
I just want you to marry a good man.

34:38.920 --> 34:39.670
I...

34:40.710 --> 34:42.360
If I never get married,

34:42.920 --> 34:44.280
would you despise me?

34:45.184 --> 34:46.944
Why don't you want to get married?

34:47.760 --> 34:48.400
I...

34:49.680 --> 34:51.952
I don't want to be trapped
in the inner courtyard,

34:52.400 --> 34:54.070
and I hate the idea of being tied down.

34:54.760 --> 34:57.030
If I marry someone I don't truly love,

34:57.590 --> 34:59.550
I'd have no control over my own life.

35:00.000 --> 35:01.840
Whether I like it or not,

35:02.160 --> 35:04.360
I'd have to put my husband's family's
reputation first,

35:04.360 --> 35:05.360
and force a smile.

35:13.880 --> 35:14.550
Yingruo,

35:15.110 --> 35:16.190
rest assured.

35:16.670 --> 35:18.440
Even if you never marry,

35:18.760 --> 35:20.920
Father and I would
never ignore your wishes

35:20.920 --> 35:22.440
and force you into a marriage.

35:22.832 --> 35:24.944
As long as you're happy,
that's all that matters.

35:27.960 --> 35:29.360
Hearing you say that

35:30.000 --> 35:31.280
puts my mind at ease.

35:38.340 --> 35:40.260
(Hanzhang Hall)

35:44.030 --> 35:44.920
Your Highness,

35:45.030 --> 35:46.880
Matron Cui has followed
your instructions

35:46.880 --> 35:48.400
and submitted her resignation
to the Empress Dowager,

35:48.400 --> 35:49.510
claiming she wants
to retire to her hometown.

35:49.510 --> 35:51.136
The Empress Dowager has approved it.

35:55.440 --> 35:58.480
Shen Xihe punished
a few of her trusted aides,

35:59.312 --> 36:01.070
so she was already scared
out of her wits.

36:02.322 --> 36:03.440
You predicted it perfectly.

36:03.440 --> 36:06.144
She didn't want to fight a losing battle
and ruin her reputation.

36:07.230 --> 36:08.736
With Matron Cui gone,

36:08.740 --> 36:10.620
it's like pulling the rug out
from under her.

36:10.630 --> 36:12.400
She came all the way from northwest,

36:12.510 --> 36:14.480
so she has no trusted aides
in the palace.

36:15.000 --> 36:17.190
Finding someone to replace Matron Cui

36:17.190 --> 36:18.150
won't be easy.

36:19.230 --> 36:21.590
Without her own people
in the General Palace Service,

36:21.960 --> 36:23.070
how will Shen Xihe

36:23.440 --> 36:25.280
manage the Six Palaces?

36:40.688 --> 36:41.840
What are you thinking about?

36:41.936 --> 36:43.030
You're so lost in thought.

36:43.510 --> 36:45.480
I was thinking
about Matron Cui's resignation.

36:46.480 --> 36:49.320
The General Palace Service
can't go unmanaged for even a day,

36:49.824 --> 36:51.670
but I haven't been
in the palace for long,

36:52.230 --> 36:54.110
so I don't really have
anyone I can trust.

37:04.510 --> 37:06.190
Want to hear your husband's opinion?

37:08.280 --> 37:08.840
Yes.

37:10.550 --> 37:11.670
You do, huh?

37:12.710 --> 37:13.480
So cute.

37:14.550 --> 37:15.760
Be serious.

37:19.670 --> 37:22.110
I saw Shen Yingruo in the palace today.

37:22.670 --> 37:23.510
I heard she

37:23.920 --> 37:25.030
plans to never marry.

37:28.110 --> 37:30.190
Yingruo's extraordinary
insight and courage

37:30.480 --> 37:31.710
truly surprised me.

37:32.510 --> 37:33.800
In terms of both character

37:34.190 --> 37:35.320
and intellect,

37:36.070 --> 37:38.550
she's open-minded and upright.

37:39.510 --> 37:41.000
Father is far away in northwest,

37:41.070 --> 37:42.440
and hasn't cared much for her,

37:43.480 --> 37:45.190
but she holds no resentment.

37:45.840 --> 37:47.480
Even towards me, her eldest sister,

37:47.760 --> 37:49.030
she shows no hostility at all.

37:49.670 --> 37:50.710
It is indeed rare.

37:50.920 --> 37:52.070
Don't you find it strange?

37:53.230 --> 37:55.550
Shen Yingruo has a crazy
and vicious biological mother,

37:56.000 --> 37:57.840
yet she didn't grow up to be

37:57.840 --> 38:00.320
a dark, paranoid, and scheming woman.

38:00.590 --> 38:01.670
What are you trying to say?

38:04.630 --> 38:06.280
Her nanny, Madam Tan,

38:06.800 --> 38:07.960
was loyal to your mother.

38:08.630 --> 38:10.710
Your mother once saved Madam Tan's life.

38:11.550 --> 38:12.760
Before your mother passed away,

38:12.880 --> 38:14.840
she arranged for her
to be Shen Yingruo's nanny.

38:15.264 --> 38:16.510
"Whether it's a boy or a girl,

38:16.710 --> 38:18.760
there's no need to harm or ruin them.

38:19.510 --> 38:20.920
Just raise them to be

38:20.920 --> 38:22.592
able to distinguish right from wrong."

38:23.312 --> 38:25.264
Mothers and daughters
are natural allies.

38:25.760 --> 38:27.070
You are just like your mother.

38:27.550 --> 38:28.630
Resourceful and strategic,

38:28.752 --> 38:30.720
but never with the intention
to harm others.

38:30.800 --> 38:31.760
Open and upright.

38:36.710 --> 38:38.440
How did you know all this?

38:40.400 --> 38:41.510
After Xiao died,

38:41.888 --> 38:44.160
I was worried Shen Yingruo
might plot against you,

38:44.710 --> 38:46.320
so I had someone investigate.

38:46.670 --> 38:48.030
I learned the whole story,

38:48.030 --> 38:49.710
and only then did I feel at ease
about her.

38:49.720 --> 38:52.130
Madam Tan was once the head
of the Imperial Ceremonial Service.

38:52.150 --> 38:53.790
She served in the palace
for twenty years,

38:53.800 --> 38:54.960
and served as Lady of Ceremonies
for eight years.

38:55.030 --> 38:55.920
Eight years?

38:56.820 --> 38:59.776
To have held the position of Lady of
Ceremonies securely for so many years,

39:00.230 --> 39:01.550
she must have a keen eye.

39:02.510 --> 39:03.760
Who is useful,

39:03.760 --> 39:04.880
who is suspicious,

39:05.400 --> 39:06.510
who is innocent,

39:06.630 --> 39:07.710
and who is smart,

39:07.880 --> 39:09.030
she must know them all.

39:09.190 --> 39:10.576
We are thinking the same thing.

39:10.880 --> 39:11.590
Madam Tan

39:12.000 --> 39:13.920
is the best successor to Matron Cui.

39:20.710 --> 39:22.670
You have already done so much for me.

39:23.630 --> 39:25.230
Even where I can't see,

39:25.600 --> 39:27.904
you are still worrying
and paving the way for me.

39:32.448 --> 39:33.590
You were the one who said it.

39:34.920 --> 39:35.960
Support each other,

39:36.544 --> 39:38.064
and help each other succeed.

39:45.030 --> 39:46.190
If one day,

39:47.590 --> 39:48.760
I am suddenly gone,

39:50.736 --> 39:52.480
you can still overcome any obstacles,

39:53.920 --> 39:55.510
stand at the heights
you want to reach,

39:55.888 --> 39:57.440
and live the life you want to live.

40:01.510 --> 40:02.550
I just hope

40:03.440 --> 40:04.880
you can live a little more freely.

40:12.256 --> 40:13.840
I'll go get some more tea and snacks.

40:30.620 --> 40:37.620
(Cultivate Virtue
and Practice Righteousness)

41:30.150 --> 41:33.550
I admire the Crown Prince's
majestic bearing,

41:33.696 --> 41:35.632
and I am willing to marry
into the East Palace

41:35.800 --> 41:36.840
as a secondary consort.

41:36.880 --> 41:39.250
Has Crown Princess not
asked even once about Princess Yaoxi?

41:39.280 --> 41:39.880
No, she hasn't.

41:39.960 --> 41:42.480
Princess Yaoxi and the Crown Prince
had a great conversation,

41:42.480 --> 41:44.448
and sat in the front courtyard
for a long time.

41:44.670 --> 41:46.400
This can't go on like this.

41:46.480 --> 41:48.816
If she doesn't come looking
for me, I won't go back.

41:52.631 --> 41:55.571
♪I've hidden so many words♪

41:56.191 --> 41:58.991
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

41:59.861 --> 42:06.831
♪So never uncover♪

42:07.021 --> 42:09.381
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

42:10.511 --> 42:13.241
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

42:14.201 --> 42:19.541
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

42:21.301 --> 42:24.121
♪Every answer I gave♪

42:24.921 --> 42:27.771
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

42:28.561 --> 42:31.931
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

42:32.191 --> 42:35.501
♪How hard it truly was?♪

42:38.471 --> 42:41.911
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

42:42.901 --> 42:45.231
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

42:46.501 --> 42:52.261
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

42:53.671 --> 42:56.801
♪It's a shame I never could♪

42:57.251 --> 43:00.261
♪Give you a moon in return♪

43:00.371 --> 43:07.011
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

43:07.011 --> 43:10.681
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

43:11.551 --> 43:14.311
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

43:14.751 --> 43:17.881
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

43:18.321 --> 43:24.271
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

43:25.671 --> 43:29.221
♪You'll never♪

43:29.501 --> 43:38.971
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

44:05.141 --> 44:08.621
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
